      <p>[1][2] For more information, refer to the multicluster engine Operator documentation <a href="https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_advanced_cluster_management_for_kubernetes/2.15/html/clusters/cluster_mce_overview#enable-cim">About enabling central infrastructure management</a>.</p>
