      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/storage/persistent_storage_local/persistent-storage-local#persistent-storage-using-local-volume">Persistent storage using local volumes</a></li>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/etcd/etcd-practices#recommended-etcd-practices">Recommended etcd practices</a></li>
