      <p class="related-resources-title">Additional resources</p>
      <ul>
      <li><ul><li><a href="https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_advanced_cluster_management_for_kubernetes/2.15/html/networking/networking#hub-network-config">Hub Network Configuration</a></li></ul></li>
